      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "现在想想的话，她一开始就是这样。\r\n她从来没将自己与生俱来的义务当作牺牲，\r\n而是打从心底里就渴求着为他人付出。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f950aeb40648fb987f2afcadf8941f2a1d91e6929d4b023e52c405e74ebd8583",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
